@startuml
title Implemented keyword REST search
actor Client
participant SearchController
participant SearchService
participant Tokenizer
participant InvertedIndex
Client -> SearchController: POST /api/search {query, mode: "keyword"}
SearchController -> SearchService: search(request)
SearchService -> SearchService: validate and capture one completed State
SearchService -> Tokenizer: tokenize(query), deduplicate terms
loop normalized terms
 SearchService -> InvertedIndex: search(term)
 InvertedIndex --> SearchService: document IDs
end
SearchService -> SearchService: OR matches, score, snapshot snippets
SearchService -> SearchService: sort by score descending, ID ascending
SearchService --> Client: 200 SearchResponse
@enduml
